# Copy this file to .kamal/secrets and fill in real values.
# .kamal/secrets is gitignored — do not commit it.
#
# Only build-time / deploy-time values live here. Runtime app secrets
# (ENGINE creds, INFLUXDB_TOKEN, cable SECRET_KEY, …) live on the production
# host at /etc/voipappz/secrets.env and are NEVER in this file, in the repo,
# or in CI.

# Docker Hub PAT used to push the built image.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=

# Optional build-time VITE_* values (baked into the public bundle — never
# secrets). Leave VITE_MOTHERSHIP_URL unset so the bundle uses relative URLs
# through the deno forwarder (ENGINE_URL on the host picks the mothership).
# VITE_MOTHERSHIP_URL=

# NOTE — destinations read a DIFFERENT file.
# `kamal deploy` (no -d) reads .kamal/secrets. But `kamal deploy -d <dest>`
# reads .kamal/secrets-common and .kamal/secrets.<dest> ONLY, and fails with
#   Secret 'KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD' not found, no secret files
#   (.kamal/secrets-common, .kamal/secrets.<dest>) provided
# So for mtn / pbx20 / nimbus, copy this to .kamal/secrets-common as well:
#   cp .kamal/secrets.example .kamal/secrets-common   # then fill it in
# Both are gitignored.
